# GMS's own shape and ten levels: a share of HP on its own clock, ending at 4%
# every 4 seconds.
#
# GMS climbs both halves in steps (ceil(L/4)+1 percent every 9 - floor(L/2)
# seconds), which base + per_level can't follow. Straightened to a fifth of a
# percent and half a second a level, which lands exactly on GMS's max and starts
# a little above its first step.
name: "Self Recovery"
description: "Regularly recovers some HP, even in combat."
kind: SKILL_KIND_PASSIVE
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_CRUSADER skill_order: 4 }
max_level: 10
base {
  regen_pct: 0.022
  regen_interval_seconds: 8.5
}
per_level {
  regen_pct: 0.002
  regen_interval_seconds: -0.5
}
